.TH FOOBAR 1 "" "foobar @VERSION@"
.SH NAME
foobar \- Print a greeting
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B foobar alpha
.RB [ \-s ]
.RB [ \-m
.IR MESSAGE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The alpha subcommand prints MESSAGE followed by a newline when provided.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-silent
Suppress message output.
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-message " MESSAGE"
Set the message.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; 1 for invalid arguments or an output error.
